WEBVTT

00:05.922 --> 00:08.007
[opening theme music]

00:38.246 --> 00:40.248
[light music]

00:50.800 --> 00:53.219
Here in Cheonbugwan,
we record the position

00:53.303 --> 00:55.054
of the stars each and every night.

00:55.138 --> 00:57.265
We even recorded one on the day
you were born.

00:57.348 --> 00:58.391
Want to see it?

00:58.475 --> 00:59.726
Yes, Daddy.

00:59.809 --> 01:00.935
[Chung laughs]

01:01.019 --> 01:03.354
Okay. Let's go.
[laughs]

01:15.116 --> 01:16.367
[Chung] You see.

01:16.451 --> 01:17.285
[gasps in amazement]

01:20.497 --> 01:23.792
[Mu-deok] My father used to study
the stars and keep records of them

01:23.875 --> 01:26.544
as Cheonbugwan's
constellation recorder mage.

01:30.006 --> 01:31.674
[all screaming]

01:32.342 --> 01:35.094
[suspenseful music]

01:39.724 --> 01:40.683
My lady!

01:40.767 --> 01:41.935
[nanny] My lady!

01:43.603 --> 01:45.230
[screaming continues]

01:52.779 --> 01:54.823
Please, my lady,
you cannot leave here for anything.

01:55.990 --> 01:58.368
If you see your father, just run away.

01:58.868 --> 02:00.245
Please do not be caught.

02:01.913 --> 02:04.207
[suspenseful music continues]

02:10.213 --> 02:11.631
- [sword clanks]
- [nanny screams]

02:18.638 --> 02:20.640
[somber music]

02:24.853 --> 02:25.728
[child Naksu] Daddy…

02:33.695 --> 02:34.904
[Chung shouts]

02:37.490 --> 02:38.783
[grunting]

02:41.286 --> 02:42.328
[shouts]

02:43.079 --> 02:45.081
[somber music continues]

03:23.161 --> 03:25.038
[Jin Mu] I promise
I will give you strength.

03:25.872 --> 03:27.165
Are you willing to follow me?

03:36.507 --> 03:39.802
[Mu-deok] The day my father was killed
by the four great families of Daeho

03:39.886 --> 03:41.763
was the day I followed Jin Mu.

03:43.097 --> 03:45.516
When I was cut off and abandoned
by the rest of the world

03:45.600 --> 03:48.478
in the deep dangerous valleys
of Danhyanggok, he took me in.

03:54.984 --> 03:57.195
- [Naksu breathing heavily]
- [upbeat music]

04:11.876 --> 04:13.044
[sword clinks]

04:19.759 --> 04:22.262
I don't know if I got stronger to survive

04:22.345 --> 04:25.139
or if I survived because I was strong.

04:28.768 --> 04:32.188
And as the world forgot about
who I was and my father,

04:33.147 --> 04:35.900
I returned as the Shadow Assassin, Naksu.

04:40.655 --> 04:42.073
But now Naksu is dead.

04:43.241 --> 04:46.327
And I have returned here as Mu-deok,

04:47.453 --> 04:49.872
along with my incompetent Young Master

04:50.456 --> 04:53.584
who is also my unmotivated pupil.

04:54.168 --> 04:56.045
[Jang Uk] How far do we have to go?

04:56.587 --> 04:57.880
This has to weigh like a hundred geun.

04:57.964 --> 05:00.008
Come on, Master,
can't you see your pupil suffering?

05:00.091 --> 05:02.719
Ugh, I can't.
I'm too tired to go any further.

05:02.802 --> 05:04.887
Even though I'm the one
carrying all the luggage?

05:04.971 --> 05:07.598
I am the Young Master,
and you are Mu-deok.

05:07.682 --> 05:08.933
Of course, you should be carrying it.

05:09.017 --> 05:10.977
So I get to be the master
when you are whining

05:11.477 --> 05:13.229
but you're the Young Master
when you need a servant?

05:13.313 --> 05:14.355
Of course.

05:18.776 --> 05:19.610
Seriously…

05:20.570 --> 05:22.989
I had no idea that there was
a place like this outside the city.

05:23.072 --> 05:24.574
Even echoes cannot escape

05:24.657 --> 05:26.659
because of how rough
and brutal this place is.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.203
The one way valley, Danhyanggok.

05:29.287 --> 05:31.122
[inhales deeply, shouts]

05:32.999 --> 05:34.459
[shout echoes]

05:34.542 --> 05:35.835
My echo came back.

05:35.918 --> 05:37.211
Oh, that's just what they call it.

05:37.295 --> 05:38.713
The name doesn't make any sense.

05:39.589 --> 05:41.257
Ugh, I am hungry.

05:43.217 --> 05:45.261
[Mu-deok] Right up there is
where I used to live.

05:45.344 --> 05:47.555
You will only eat
whatever food I provide you

05:47.638 --> 05:51.184
and you will sleep wherever you collapse
after training hard every day.

05:52.393 --> 05:53.561
[sniffs]

05:54.479 --> 05:55.897
What is that? Is that chicken?

05:56.397 --> 05:58.566
[sniffs]
There's a chicken shop here.

05:58.649 --> 06:00.443
Why would there be
any chicken shop up here?

06:02.737 --> 06:05.490
- [sniffs]
- You see! It's chicken, right?

06:05.573 --> 06:07.241
- Yeah, that smells like chicken.
- [sniffs]

06:07.825 --> 06:10.536
Oh, it… it really is chicken.
I… I love chicken.

06:11.329 --> 06:12.830
Ooh, how did you get up there?

06:12.914 --> 06:13.831
[grunts]

06:13.915 --> 06:15.708
There has to be a chicken shop, Mu-deok.

06:15.792 --> 06:17.460
Come down. What are you doing up so high?

06:19.045 --> 06:20.129
[Jang Uk sniffing]

06:23.216 --> 06:24.258
Wow, wow!

06:24.967 --> 06:26.052
[exhales excitedly]

06:26.135 --> 06:27.804
Oh, I told you there is chicken!

06:27.887 --> 06:30.932
I knew that there was chicken here.
Wow, this is an incredible place!

06:50.493 --> 06:52.120
Why are all these things around here?

06:54.497 --> 06:55.331
Mu-deok!

06:56.374 --> 06:58.292
There's a bath in here, too!

06:58.376 --> 07:00.044
[yelps]
Wow!

07:01.504 --> 07:02.338
[door closes]

07:06.717 --> 07:07.593
[exhales]

07:07.677 --> 07:08.678
Mu-deok.

07:08.761 --> 07:12.932
There is a ton of food we can eat, yeah.
The bath is really nice, too.

07:13.015 --> 07:15.184
Hey, Master, if you lived
in a place like this,

07:15.268 --> 07:17.520
why did you even try
and scare your pupil, huh?

07:17.603 --> 07:18.438
You're so weird!

07:20.773 --> 07:22.191
[huffs]
There's a blanket.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.110
[Jang Uk sighs]

07:24.193 --> 07:26.737
[chuckles]
It's so soft and comfy.

07:26.821 --> 07:29.031
- [sighs happily]
- I didn't do any of this.

07:30.658 --> 07:32.368
There is someone currently living here.

07:37.665 --> 07:38.499
Mu-deok.

07:39.000 --> 07:42.336
So, should we eat the chicken, hmm?
It looked like it'll be very delicious.

07:42.420 --> 07:43.588
Mu-deok?

07:49.343 --> 07:50.511
Does a man live here?

07:51.012 --> 07:52.763
[dog growling]

07:58.186 --> 07:59.520
[barking, growling]

07:59.604 --> 08:01.647
[ominous music]

08:05.443 --> 08:06.486
[howling]

08:09.864 --> 08:10.865
- [barks]
- [gasps]

08:12.366 --> 08:13.576
- Stop there!
- [growls]

08:15.495 --> 08:16.454
Stay there, boy.

08:21.334 --> 08:22.168
[exhales]

08:22.835 --> 08:23.961
[whining]

08:28.716 --> 08:30.426
Mm-hmm, what a good boy!

08:30.510 --> 08:32.345
[Jang Uk] So well-trained!
Do you live here?

08:33.054 --> 08:34.263
He is not a stray dog.

08:35.473 --> 08:36.724
Where did your owner go?

08:37.558 --> 08:39.519
Come on, Fluffy.
Go fetch your owner, okay?

08:41.729 --> 08:44.273
Oh, wow, so clever! Hmm.

08:44.357 --> 08:45.191
[sighs]

08:46.025 --> 08:46.901
Who could it be?

08:47.693 --> 08:49.862
Seeing as they are not trying
to hide themselves,

08:50.446 --> 08:51.864
this can't be one of Danju's men.

08:52.365 --> 08:54.158
[clicks tongue, exhales softly]

08:54.992 --> 08:56.035
[Jang Uk] There's tea.

08:56.118 --> 08:59.163
Since we are guests here,
should be fine if we have a cup, right?

08:59.664 --> 09:01.916
- This looks great!
- You shouldn't eat or drink any of it.

09:02.708 --> 09:04.335
We should check and see
who lives here first.

09:04.835 --> 09:06.212
And then find somewhere else to stay.

09:06.712 --> 09:07.964
You really have no idea?

09:08.589 --> 09:09.423
Huh?

09:09.507 --> 09:11.384
I mean the dog, the blooming flowers,

09:11.884 --> 09:13.803
roasted chicken and warm tea.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.179
I was getting the wrong idea.

09:15.805 --> 09:16.639
Idea?

09:16.722 --> 09:19.183
I thought for a second you're using
training as an excuse to kidnap

09:19.267 --> 09:21.060
your Young Master
and settle down with him.

09:21.143 --> 09:23.437
If that fluffy dog had wagged
its tail at you,

09:23.521 --> 09:26.148
I would have thought
"Wow, Mu-deok planned all of this".

09:26.232 --> 09:28.359
I mean, look at this place.
It's perfect for a family.

09:29.068 --> 09:30.945
It wasn't like this
when I was here last time, okay?

09:31.529 --> 09:34.407
It was completely empty, and it was
perfect to devote time to training,

09:34.490 --> 09:35.575
which is why I brought you here.

09:37.159 --> 09:38.452
Seriously, just to train?

09:39.787 --> 09:41.163
Just to devote ourselves?

09:41.872 --> 09:44.292
Drop it now!
Have as much poison as you want.

09:44.375 --> 09:46.085
I hope it makes your insides explode.

09:47.712 --> 09:49.547
Come on! I was only joking.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.507
She had to say
she hopes my insides explode.

09:52.008 --> 09:55.219
How stupid am I to trust that thing
to be my master and follow her here?

09:55.761 --> 09:56.721
Oh, man!

10:01.559 --> 10:02.643
[sighs]

10:05.396 --> 10:07.273
[Jin] Continue to remain the Young Master…

10:08.774 --> 10:11.485
of the Jang family
who doesn't know anything.

10:13.362 --> 10:14.488
This place will be fine…

10:15.948 --> 10:17.116
to live like that.

10:23.372 --> 10:25.374
[dramatic music]

11:03.913 --> 11:06.207
[Jin Mu] Today, the leader
of Jinyowon has called to order

11:06.290 --> 11:07.792
the Unanimous Assembly of Daeho.

11:07.875 --> 11:08.918
UNANIMOUS ASSEMBLY: A GATHERING
OF LEADERS OF GREAT MAGE FAMILIES

11:09.001 --> 11:12.463
With the exception of the Jang family,
all 11 families have arrived.

11:12.546 --> 11:16.467
Do you think my duel with Jang Uk
is important enough that they must gather?

11:16.550 --> 11:19.470
[Sun] It is a duel between
the royal family and the mages.

11:20.054 --> 11:21.347
The first in hundreds of years.

11:21.430 --> 11:24.183
I am merely trying to teach
a valuable lesson to Jang Uk

11:24.266 --> 11:26.143
for making a joke
out of myself, the Crown Prince.

11:26.227 --> 11:28.354
But this was not a private dispute.

11:28.437 --> 11:31.232
His Majesty ordered
the Unanimous Assembly to gather.

11:31.315 --> 11:35.569
If they agree that this duel must happen,
officially, you two must fight.

11:36.779 --> 11:39.281
A crack has formed in the stability

11:40.157 --> 11:42.576
between our family and the four houses.

11:42.660 --> 11:44.578
[tense music]

11:55.673 --> 11:59.844
Is it true that you decided to open up
the position of Cheonbugwan's Gwanju?

12:01.095 --> 12:02.430
Yes, it's true.

12:04.849 --> 12:05.683
[all sigh]

12:07.059 --> 12:08.477
This duel is merely a way to resolve

12:08.561 --> 12:11.063
a misunderstanding
between the Crown Prince and Jang Uk.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.440
For the Gwanju position,

12:13.315 --> 12:17.319
I already was in discussion
to name someone other than Jang Uk.

12:17.403 --> 12:19.738
Having it taken away
is different from giving it up.

12:20.948 --> 12:24.410
From what I heard, Jang Uk ran away
before he even received the offer to duel.

12:24.493 --> 12:25.661
[chuckles]

12:26.328 --> 12:27.705
How embarrassing is this!

12:27.788 --> 12:31.208
Even if it's entailed death,
he should fight honorably as a mage.

12:31.292 --> 12:33.544
Do you really think
that Uk has the courage to do that?

12:34.962 --> 12:37.882
Has not everyone here had to
endure him as their pupil at least--

12:37.965 --> 12:38.883
- [mages murmur]
- Jang Uk thought he knew better

12:38.966 --> 12:40.092
than all of us.

12:40.176 --> 12:44.180
As things are, we will all be disgraced.
How about the Assembly?

12:44.263 --> 12:46.932
Take away every single right
that Jang Uk has as a mage.

12:48.142 --> 12:49.226
[Heo Yeom clears throat]

12:50.227 --> 12:53.689
The decision of the Unanimous Assembly
to strip one's rights

12:53.772 --> 12:57.026
will cut off all their energy
and their abilities.

12:57.109 --> 12:59.820
Do you suggest we ruin
this young man's life?

12:59.904 --> 13:01.739
But that could allow us
to stop this duel, right?

13:02.615 --> 13:06.911
[monk] Jang Uk's gate of energy has been
closed once before by his own father.

13:06.994 --> 13:08.871
[mage] He is right.
He's correct, isn't he?

13:08.954 --> 13:10.331
Hasn't everyone here at least once…

13:11.165 --> 13:14.293
taken in Jang Uk as one
of their own students. Isn't that correct?

13:14.376 --> 13:15.461
Hmm.

13:17.421 --> 13:19.048
How can you consider ruining the life

13:19.131 --> 13:22.259
of someone you took on as a student
with such indifferent right now?

13:22.343 --> 13:23.427
[all clear throat awkwardly]

13:24.178 --> 13:27.389
Songrim has already accepted
the request for a duel.

13:27.473 --> 13:30.392
Songrim will take on any disgrace
that may occur upon it.

13:30.976 --> 13:33.062
So then, make sure
this is an official duel

13:33.145 --> 13:35.314
between Songrim and the royal family.

13:36.398 --> 13:37.233
Yes.

13:38.651 --> 13:41.695
I heard Jang Uk mastered Ryusu
in a short amount of time.

13:42.613 --> 13:45.282
Is there a master at Songrim
who has been training him?

13:48.786 --> 13:49.828
Be at Songrim…

13:51.163 --> 13:52.331
or anywhere,

13:53.999 --> 13:57.628
Jang Uk has… no one to teach him.

14:01.090 --> 14:02.091
[Jang Uk exhales relievedly]

14:02.174 --> 14:04.677
Ugh, the water's so lovely.
It's so relaxing.

14:04.760 --> 14:06.011
Maybe it's mineral water.

14:06.720 --> 14:10.391
Mu-deok, the owner of this place
must be a very tidy person.

14:10.474 --> 14:11.976
I don't think they will be back to--

14:15.479 --> 14:16.522
[sighs]

14:22.987 --> 14:23.821
[clicks tongue]

14:31.078 --> 14:32.580
She's completely passed out.

14:33.163 --> 14:35.666
Yeah, of course, you are exhausted.
We could have taken our time,

14:35.749 --> 14:37.543
but you insisted
that we hurry and get here.

14:37.626 --> 14:40.588
You're not Naksu, you're Mu-deok now.
You have no energy anymore.

14:45.551 --> 14:46.635
Hey, that's…

14:47.761 --> 14:48.804
That's heavy.

14:48.888 --> 14:51.015
Oh, you idiot! If it was that heavy,

14:51.098 --> 14:53.976
you should have just asked me to carry
instead of acting so strong.

14:55.060 --> 14:56.020
[sighs]

15:00.316 --> 15:02.359
Ooh, this is so comfy.

15:08.282 --> 15:10.326
I mean, I am the Young Master, you know.

15:10.951 --> 15:13.454
And she's just my servant, yeah.

15:14.872 --> 15:16.665
It's only right we sleep like this, yeah.

15:28.844 --> 15:29.929
[sighs]

15:30.012 --> 15:32.473
Seriously, this doesn't feel good.

15:33.140 --> 15:35.142
[light music]

15:37.561 --> 15:38.395
[sighs]

15:42.024 --> 15:42.858
Come on!

15:56.413 --> 15:58.540
Master, I hope you sleep well.

16:23.649 --> 16:24.942
Ugh, so uncomfortable.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.194
[sighs]

16:34.118 --> 16:35.452
[thunder rumbles]

16:37.204 --> 16:39.206
[eerie music]

16:47.548 --> 16:49.717
[dog growls, barks]

16:50.801 --> 16:52.886
[dog howls]

16:53.470 --> 16:55.681
Are you saying
there's a soul shifter inside there?

16:55.764 --> 16:56.724
[dog barking]

16:59.893 --> 17:01.186
How very interesting!

17:11.697 --> 17:12.781
[thunder rumbles]

17:15.868 --> 17:16.702
[floor creaks]

17:28.964 --> 17:31.133
She doesn't give off any evil energy.

17:31.216 --> 17:33.302
Without your help,
I wouldn't have recognized her.

17:37.765 --> 17:42.311
Rather than let you run wild,
it'll be better if you die in my hand.

17:45.689 --> 17:47.691
[suspenseful music]

18:09.755 --> 18:12.132
[Master Lee] There's a great soul
who shifted into this body.

18:13.801 --> 18:17.513
Having entered into such a weak body,
she should have run wild by now.

18:18.263 --> 18:20.140
How can it be that she's still fine?

18:28.315 --> 18:31.860
The energy's gone.
Where did that energy I just sensed go?

18:38.033 --> 18:39.076
Who are you, then?

18:41.578 --> 18:43.163
I could ask you the same.

18:43.247 --> 18:44.998
Get away from Mu-deok right now.

18:45.666 --> 18:47.668
[tense music]

18:53.257 --> 18:54.466
[exhales deeply]

19:09.481 --> 19:10.774
[Jang Uk grunting]

19:17.614 --> 19:19.700
[thunder rumbles]

19:24.496 --> 19:25.831
[breathes heavily]

19:31.086 --> 19:31.920
[grunts]

19:32.796 --> 19:33.714
[yelps]

19:35.549 --> 19:36.425
[shouts]

19:43.015 --> 19:44.224
[breathes heavily]

19:46.143 --> 19:47.102
[yells]

19:56.528 --> 19:58.530
[Jang Uk groaning]

20:20.093 --> 20:23.096
[Master Lee] This is the sword given
by the king to Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

20:23.680 --> 20:24.973
Who are you really?

20:25.807 --> 20:27.893
And what would you be doing
with a girl like her?

20:32.022 --> 20:33.065
[shouts]
Mu-deok, run!

21:05.472 --> 21:07.474
[dramatic music]

21:36.086 --> 21:38.088
[brooding music]

21:56.982 --> 21:57.858
[Jang Uk sighs]

22:00.152 --> 22:02.612
[Jang Uk] Oh, you're up now.

22:07.284 --> 22:08.243
Who are…

22:08.327 --> 22:10.245
Oh, he's the man from last night. Hmm.

22:10.996 --> 22:12.247
Man from last night?

22:12.331 --> 22:14.124
You saw him. Don't you remember?

22:18.378 --> 22:19.546
[Jang Uk shouts] Mu-deok, run!

22:20.714 --> 22:21.631
[groans]

22:24.926 --> 22:26.928
[tense music]

22:34.686 --> 22:35.562
[gasps]

22:40.192 --> 22:42.194
[soft music]

22:55.791 --> 22:57.584
[Mater Lee] I'm sorry for last night.

22:57.667 --> 22:59.461
After I saw that
someone was inside my hut,

22:59.544 --> 23:02.589
and you suddenly drew your sword,
I didn't have much choice.

23:02.672 --> 23:04.007
I was startled too when I saw you.

23:04.091 --> 23:06.843
I need more training.
I can't control the energy in my arm.

23:06.927 --> 23:08.637
I had no intention of harming you, sir.

23:08.720 --> 23:09.846
Did you both…

23:10.847 --> 23:11.723
fight each other?

23:15.894 --> 23:17.854
You really don't remember
anything that happened last night?

23:18.980 --> 23:19.815
No.

23:19.898 --> 23:22.943
Last night, you stood right there
and watched the two of us fight.

23:23.026 --> 23:24.277
Did I see that?

23:24.361 --> 23:25.195
[Jang Uk] Mm-hmm.

23:25.862 --> 23:27.614
You must've been sleepwalking.

23:27.697 --> 23:31.284
I'll go find some medicinal herbs
that I can brew into a tea for you.

23:31.910 --> 23:33.370
Are you an herbalist, then?

23:33.453 --> 23:35.038
Oh, nothing like that.
He says he came out here to pick

23:35.122 --> 23:37.249
the medicinal herbs
that grow in Danhyanggok.

23:37.332 --> 23:38.250
You can call me Master Lee.

23:38.333 --> 23:41.002
There's plenty of food
and enough space for all of us here,

23:41.086 --> 23:43.130
so feel free to make yourselves at home.

23:43.213 --> 23:44.923
[dog barking]

23:46.341 --> 23:47.884
- [Master Lee] Sapsali.
- [dog whining]

23:50.178 --> 23:51.513
[Jang Uk] Do you really not remember?

23:51.596 --> 23:52.973
[Mu-deok] Was I really sleepwalking?

24:07.654 --> 24:08.864
I swear I fell asleep on…

24:08.947 --> 24:11.449
There's something
very special about that soul shifter.

24:11.533 --> 24:13.201
It's incredible that
there's such a great soul

24:13.285 --> 24:14.744
dwelling in such a small body.

24:14.828 --> 24:16.538
[Jang Uk] I moved you because
I thought you had been uncomfortable.

24:16.621 --> 24:18.081
- [Mu-deok] You moved me, Young Master?
- I should keep an eye on her

24:18.165 --> 24:18.999
a little longer.

24:19.082 --> 24:20.542
You don't need to lie to me.

24:20.625 --> 24:23.211
I'm serious. I moved you
because I was worried about you, okay?

24:23.295 --> 24:24.671
How do you two know each other?

24:26.923 --> 24:28.216
Are you married?

24:28.300 --> 24:29.801
- Not at all.
- Not at all.

24:29.885 --> 24:31.386
[Mu-deok] No way
you moved me, Young Master.

24:31.469 --> 24:33.013
I can at least remember that much.

24:33.096 --> 24:34.347
[Jang Uk] Is there a reason
that I would lie to you?

24:34.431 --> 24:35.640
- I really did move…
- [Mu-deok] You're lying constantly,

24:35.724 --> 24:36.558
- Young Master.
- Definitely married!

24:37.475 --> 24:38.643
- I said we are not.
- I said we are not.

24:39.227 --> 24:40.812
[Mu-deok] So then, did you win last night?

24:40.896 --> 24:42.439
No, I lost real bad. But…

24:43.315 --> 24:44.691
this guy's just so strong.

24:44.774 --> 24:46.985
- That man is--
- Oh, what a good job! I just knew it.

24:47.068 --> 24:47.903
[Jang Uk] Huh?

24:52.282 --> 24:54.201
They even gathered the Unanimous Assembly.

24:54.284 --> 24:55.827
It's getting out of hand.

24:55.911 --> 24:59.247
Do you think they're…
Uk and Mu-deok are doing all right?

24:59.331 --> 25:02.000
Since they went to Sari Village,
Mu-deok must be happy

25:02.083 --> 25:03.251
going back to her hometown.

25:05.128 --> 25:06.671
Why would Mu-deok be happy?

25:06.755 --> 25:07.881
She can't even see you.

25:07.964 --> 25:10.217
- See me?
- Oh, you moron!

25:10.300 --> 25:13.345
- Mu-deok is absolutely in love with you.
- [coughs]

25:14.221 --> 25:16.181
- [door opens]
- No, not true!

25:17.140 --> 25:18.475
She only said that to help Uk.

25:18.558 --> 25:20.268
Oh, okay, sure then.

25:23.146 --> 25:26.107
I heard from some other girls
that Master Uk has run away.

25:26.191 --> 25:30.403
Hey, hey! How can you say that?
He has briefly fled to take refuge.

25:30.487 --> 25:31.947
How's that different from what I said?

25:32.030 --> 25:34.699
So, did he go to Danhyanggok with Mu-deok?

25:36.576 --> 25:38.662
- Danhyanggok?
- [Ju-wol] Yes.

25:38.745 --> 25:40.080
A while back, she shot up fireworks there,

25:40.163 --> 25:42.123
saying that the Young Master
ordered her to do it.

25:42.207 --> 25:44.751
I remember that.
I could see them from inside the city.

25:44.834 --> 25:47.963
I figured that must be where they went
since it's only half-a-day's journey.

25:48.046 --> 25:50.715
- That right?
- Mm-mm.

25:50.799 --> 25:53.677
Mu-deok took him over
to her hometown in Sari Village.

25:53.760 --> 25:55.762
Oh, Sari Village.

25:55.845 --> 25:57.973
You cannot tell anyone
that Uk is there now.

25:58.556 --> 26:00.225
Yes, of course not.

26:00.308 --> 26:01.226
Please enjoy.

26:03.812 --> 26:05.939
So, Mu-deok went to Danhyanggok, then?

26:06.022 --> 26:07.524
- It's pretty dangerous.
- [door closes]

26:07.607 --> 26:09.943
That's where you used to
keep your pet bird. Isn't that right?

26:10.652 --> 26:12.696
You hurt your leg out there
and worried everyone.

26:13.655 --> 26:15.073
Yeah, it was Danhyanggok.

26:17.450 --> 26:19.327
I had almost forgotten about that place.

26:19.411 --> 26:21.413
[somber music]

26:33.091 --> 26:34.217
[Master Lee] The fire is going out.

26:39.264 --> 26:41.891
Judging by his strength, his body must be
filled with a lot of energy.

26:44.894 --> 26:46.521
Jipsu has definitely been mastered.

26:46.604 --> 26:47.772
JIPSU: THE STAGE OF GATHERING ENERGY
USING SPELLS

26:47.856 --> 26:49.566
Jipsu, huh?
That means he's as strong as I am.

26:49.649 --> 26:52.068
No wonder I had
such a hard time fighting him.

26:53.153 --> 26:55.238
[thrilling music]

27:01.619 --> 27:03.788
[Mu-deok] He's using
his energy to control the fire.

27:03.872 --> 27:04.914
That man…

27:05.874 --> 27:07.000
is above Ryusu.

27:07.083 --> 27:09.127
RYUSU: THE STAGE OF EMITTING
ENERGY FROM THE BODY

27:09.711 --> 27:11.254
Ryusu? Oh!

27:11.880 --> 27:14.466
He's a lot stronger than me.
That was a close call, then.

27:19.721 --> 27:21.306
[Master Lee]
Hmm, the rain made them all wet.

27:43.536 --> 27:44.704
That's Chisu.

27:45.288 --> 27:47.332
To be able to dry those clothes so easily,

27:47.415 --> 27:50.126
he must be a master
even among the higher levels of Chisu.

27:56.925 --> 27:58.134
Higher levels of Chisu?

27:59.886 --> 28:01.304
I could have died, then.

28:05.016 --> 28:06.476
Very good. Nice and dry.

28:10.772 --> 28:11.606
Oh.

28:12.732 --> 28:13.733
[Jang Uk clears throat]

28:15.485 --> 28:16.820
[Master Lee] Do not drink that tea!

28:21.574 --> 28:23.076
Did you drink this entire pot?

28:23.159 --> 28:24.160
Yes.

28:24.244 --> 28:26.329
You're okay? Do you feel unwell?

28:26.413 --> 28:27.288
Um… uh…

28:28.957 --> 28:30.750
- Are these poisonous herbs?
- Huh?

28:30.834 --> 28:32.293
[Master Lee] No, they're not poisonous.

28:32.377 --> 28:33.670
They're chaste herbs.

28:33.753 --> 28:35.004
Chaste herbs?

28:35.088 --> 28:36.339
These are chaste herbs?

28:36.923 --> 28:39.968
So then earlier, when you said you were
looking for herbs native to Danhyanggok,

28:40.051 --> 28:41.386
were you speaking of chaste herbs?

28:42.345 --> 28:43.596
[stutters]
What?

28:43.680 --> 28:45.515
So, you know about chaste herbs, then?

28:45.598 --> 28:48.518
Only that there are some mages
who drink tea made from it

28:48.601 --> 28:50.562
to lower their libido
so it doesn't distract them

28:50.645 --> 28:51.980
from focusing on their spells.

28:53.398 --> 28:55.108
Lower their libido? What do you mean?

28:55.900 --> 28:58.695
One of the five desires
of humanity, sexual desire.

28:58.778 --> 29:00.280
S-Sexual desire?

29:00.363 --> 29:01.197
[gasps]

29:01.698 --> 29:02.907
[groans]

29:02.991 --> 29:05.076
Chaste herbs cut off…

29:06.578 --> 29:09.789
the energy that causes
sexual desires that consume us.

29:09.873 --> 29:10.790
[exhales in disbelief]

29:11.958 --> 29:14.753
I've heard of a mage
who was able to achieve such high levels

29:14.836 --> 29:17.505
by cutting off his libido
to master a variety of spells.

29:17.589 --> 29:20.759
People say he only wears thin clothes
made from hemp all year round.

29:20.842 --> 29:24.053
So, many would call him "Hemp Master Lee".

29:24.137 --> 29:27.849
For someone who's a mere servant,
you sure know about a lot of things.

29:30.477 --> 29:33.688
It is such an honor to meet a mage
who has mastered many high level spells.

29:34.230 --> 29:36.191
I'm honored to meet you, Hemp Master Lee.

29:36.274 --> 29:37.108
[chuckles]

29:37.192 --> 29:38.818
[epic music]

29:44.949 --> 29:45.784
[Mu-deok] Young Master.

29:45.867 --> 29:47.786
What are you doing?
Aren't you going to pay your respects?

29:48.870 --> 29:50.830
[whimsical music]

29:50.914 --> 29:54.209
Does this… mean
my libido has been cut off?

29:55.752 --> 29:56.711
No.

29:56.795 --> 29:57.796
No, no!

29:57.879 --> 29:59.422
No, no, no!

29:59.506 --> 30:02.050
No, no, this cannot be!
You have to help me!

30:03.051 --> 30:05.637
Drinking a single pot of tea
isn't enough to cut it off.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.555
Are you sure of that?
You need to tell me the truth!

30:07.639 --> 30:09.641
[Master Lee] It's the truth.
If you're so worried,

30:09.724 --> 30:12.185
I can make you a tonic
that will return all of your vigor.

30:13.144 --> 30:14.062
[relieved sigh]

30:14.145 --> 30:16.773
Thank you so much. Thank you so much, sir!

30:16.856 --> 30:17.857
[Mu-deok] Master Lee.

30:17.941 --> 30:20.693
Could you please help
my Young Master here?

30:20.777 --> 30:22.153
He's really been struggling

30:22.237 --> 30:25.156
to control the energy
that is focused on his right arm.

30:25.240 --> 30:29.160
Master Lee, could you please
teach him how to control this energy?

30:29.244 --> 30:30.912
Teaching him wouldn't be difficult at all,

30:30.995 --> 30:33.957
but if you do wish to learn from me,
you must do everything that I say.

30:34.040 --> 30:35.250
Could you do that?

30:35.333 --> 30:36.751
[Mu-deok] He's willing to do anything.

30:36.835 --> 30:37.752
Yeah, right?

30:39.420 --> 30:40.797
W-W-W-What…

30:41.881 --> 30:43.049
will you need me to do?

30:43.132 --> 30:44.259
As I have,

30:45.009 --> 30:46.469
you must drink lots of chaste tea.

30:46.553 --> 30:47.679
[gasps]

30:47.762 --> 30:50.181
Can you cut off…

30:52.851 --> 30:53.935
your libido?

30:58.523 --> 31:00.149
Did you really drink all this tea?

31:00.650 --> 31:01.484
Yes.

31:02.610 --> 31:03.695
You can do it?

31:08.241 --> 31:09.284
[mumbles]

31:15.748 --> 31:18.001
Who cares if he is some renowned mage?

31:18.084 --> 31:21.588
He's stuck in the mountains all alone
without a pupil for a good reason.

31:22.130 --> 31:24.299
His training method would
definitely speed things up.

31:25.383 --> 31:28.136
If you study under him, you'll learn
how to control that energy much quicker.

31:28.219 --> 31:31.806
No. He wants me to keep drinking
that chaste herb tea, and that's insane.

31:31.890 --> 31:36.352
I'm… I'm already highly disturbed
that I drank that pot yesterday.

31:36.436 --> 31:38.813
I wonder if just
one bowl of tonic will be enough.

31:38.897 --> 31:40.773
It's not entirely a bad idea to try it.

31:41.900 --> 31:43.860
For someone who has nothing else to lose,

31:43.943 --> 31:47.322
by cutting off their sex drive,
it's not a bad method to train with.

31:48.156 --> 31:49.198
[exhales softly]

31:49.282 --> 31:50.575
[bowl clanks]

31:51.409 --> 31:52.827
So that person you just spoke of,

31:52.911 --> 31:54.704
are you referring to
your Young Master right now?

31:56.664 --> 31:58.666
Mu-deok, do you mean me?
Look me in the eye!

31:58.750 --> 32:00.251
Yeah! So?

32:00.335 --> 32:02.211
Just think about it.
This could be your only chance.

32:02.295 --> 32:04.589
You're incredibly lucky
to have met a master like him.

32:04.672 --> 32:05.548
[scoffs]

32:05.632 --> 32:07.258
Cut off your libido for a bit,

32:08.301 --> 32:09.302
and get rid of this.

32:09.385 --> 32:11.888
Ugh! Don't talk lightly
about cutting off my libido.

32:11.971 --> 32:14.015
Impotence is a small sacrifice
to be great.

32:14.098 --> 32:15.892
Look here! L-Look here!

32:15.975 --> 32:18.436
You're saying it doesn't matter
if it's cut off permanently, right?

32:18.519 --> 32:19.979
Don't obsess over your useless sex drive.

32:20.063 --> 32:22.607
Useless or not, it's mine,
and it's very precious to me, okay?

32:33.284 --> 32:34.535
Hey, hey!

32:34.619 --> 32:37.246
Hey, Mu-deok, are you doing all right?

32:38.247 --> 32:40.083
I didn't… What just happened?

32:41.417 --> 32:42.251
Ryusu.

32:44.587 --> 32:46.965
That energy within you trickled out,
and you just used that power.

32:48.466 --> 32:50.885
If even a small amount
of power is this strong,

32:51.469 --> 32:53.888
I would have died if you weren't
wearing a binding bracelet

32:54.597 --> 32:56.349
and had used your full force.

32:56.432 --> 32:57.558
[Mu-deok laughs]

33:00.186 --> 33:01.604
Hey, you… you are bleeding.

33:04.190 --> 33:06.025
Tell me, have you lost your mind?

33:06.109 --> 33:08.111
- Are you happy you almost died?
- Mm-hmm.

33:08.194 --> 33:10.989
I am. My pupil is getting much stronger.

33:14.701 --> 33:18.079
At the moment, it may seem to be
an insignificant drop of water,

33:18.162 --> 33:21.374
but soon, it will be a stream,
and then a great river,

33:22.166 --> 33:25.545
until finally, you'll have power
as vast as Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

33:28.339 --> 33:30.133
And I'll be able to regain my power.

33:43.938 --> 33:47.108
You should wipe the blood off your face
before it fills up Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

33:47.191 --> 33:48.026
[chuckles]

33:50.319 --> 33:51.320
It must hurt. Geez.

33:51.404 --> 33:53.031
I can hardly feel it.

33:53.114 --> 33:55.158
Stop acting tough, okay?

33:59.495 --> 34:00.747
Year one of Go Sun.

34:01.497 --> 34:03.624
[Jin] The first day of April.

34:10.423 --> 34:11.674
GO SUN, YEAR ONE
FIRST DAY OF APRIL

34:11.758 --> 34:15.303
[Gang] The night that child was born,
The King's Star was in the sky.

34:15.386 --> 34:18.014
No one else can know
that the star ever appeared.

34:18.097 --> 34:20.600
But Cheonbugwan will have a record of it.

34:20.683 --> 34:23.019
I have already stolen the plate
that recorded the stars that night.

34:23.102 --> 34:24.187
The one in Cheonbugwan…

34:25.563 --> 34:27.190
is a fake without the King's Star.

34:28.775 --> 34:32.695
The truth behind that child's birth
must never become known.

34:37.658 --> 34:40.244
Do you see any interesting stars in there?

34:49.128 --> 34:53.508
That's the day Lady Do-hwa died,
the same day that Jang Uk was born.

34:55.968 --> 34:57.637
So, the Unanimous Assembly…

34:58.596 --> 35:00.765
all the mages of the noble families

35:00.848 --> 35:03.142
had to gather together
because of little me?

35:05.937 --> 35:07.230
[Jin] Have you not considered…

35:08.022 --> 35:09.774
starting your own family line?

35:10.900 --> 35:12.860
You could receive everyone's vote.

35:13.778 --> 35:18.366
You want the opportunity to become
a member of the Assembly, too, don't you?

35:18.449 --> 35:19.867
[laughs]

35:21.077 --> 35:24.497
I'm a member of the Jin family.
Jinyowon is my family.

35:27.542 --> 35:29.418
What brings you
all the way to Cheonbugwan?

35:29.502 --> 35:32.922
The soul shifter found was a constellation
recorder mage of Cheonbugwan.

35:34.048 --> 35:36.759
We ask for your cooperation
so that the mages of Jeongjingak

35:37.260 --> 35:38.386
can come and investigate.

35:39.095 --> 35:41.055
What do you intend to investigate?

35:41.139 --> 35:42.306
[Jin chuckles]

35:45.810 --> 35:46.686
Why do you care?

35:47.728 --> 35:49.730
You don't have something to hide, do you?

35:49.814 --> 35:51.065
[chuckles]

35:52.775 --> 35:54.902
What would I possibly have to hide?

35:55.403 --> 35:57.280
They're welcome anytime.

35:58.614 --> 36:00.908
They're here right now.

36:04.704 --> 36:06.706
[epic music]

36:26.350 --> 36:29.395
That mage's job was
to maintain the energy in here,

36:29.478 --> 36:30.688
so it won't dissipate.

36:31.939 --> 36:34.233
He was in charge of this section.

36:43.159 --> 36:46.370
What? There's a dead body
inside Cheonbugwan right now?

36:46.454 --> 36:49.457
The man consumed
by Eunuch Kim is in the secret room.

36:49.540 --> 36:52.001
[ominous music]

37:04.430 --> 37:06.807
[Seo Yul] The mage that the soul
shifted into worked here.

37:06.891 --> 37:09.977
However, he did receive warnings
for looking at constellation plates.

37:13.564 --> 37:14.398
My lord.

37:15.483 --> 37:17.360
There are several people
who are listed as officials

37:17.443 --> 37:18.861
that seem to have disappeared.

37:18.945 --> 37:20.321
Where do you think
they could have gone off to?

37:27.119 --> 37:28.704
Thank you for your cooperation.

37:29.372 --> 37:30.331
Don't mention it.

37:30.873 --> 37:33.125
I have one more request
that I'd like to ask.

37:34.001 --> 37:35.461
I understand this is rude of me,

37:36.379 --> 37:39.966
but I'd like to take a look
inside Cheonbugwan secret room

37:40.049 --> 37:42.051
[tense music]

37:57.858 --> 37:59.527
Feel free to look around.

38:04.156 --> 38:06.158
[menacing music]

38:25.928 --> 38:28.597
[Jin Mu] Use the underground tunnel
to remove the corpse.

38:41.027 --> 38:43.446
[Jin] If they are hiding something,
they'll try to get rid of it quickly.

38:44.613 --> 38:45.990
Watch and follow his men.

38:50.369 --> 38:51.329
Go faster.

38:55.541 --> 38:56.375
[man grunts]

38:57.710 --> 38:58.544
[horse neighs]

39:04.967 --> 39:06.886
We saw this wagon exiting Cheonbugwan.

39:07.553 --> 39:08.763
Are you a mage there?

39:08.846 --> 39:09.972
Show us your face.

39:10.056 --> 39:11.265
We need to check and see what's inside.

39:11.349 --> 39:13.517
[tense music]

39:19.690 --> 39:20.608
[man shouts]

39:29.408 --> 39:30.743
[men grunting]

39:35.164 --> 39:36.957
[grunting continues]

39:43.172 --> 39:44.298
- [yells]
- [horse neighs]

39:46.467 --> 39:47.343
[all grunt]

39:54.892 --> 39:55.810
Go after him!

39:56.477 --> 39:58.396
[action music]

40:16.705 --> 40:17.915
[action music fades]

40:30.094 --> 40:32.096
[suspenseful music]

40:40.187 --> 40:41.230
[panting]

40:43.899 --> 40:45.443
[Dang-gu] The man I was fighting ran off.

40:46.819 --> 40:48.154
Did the guy in the wagon flee, too?

40:50.656 --> 40:51.824
[Seo Yul] I found this inside.

40:52.533 --> 40:53.951
That's the Songrim's Spirit Plaque.

40:54.785 --> 40:56.912
Were those men also from Songrim?

40:58.080 --> 41:00.082
[tense music]

41:03.169 --> 41:04.336
[water sloshing gently]

41:12.553 --> 41:15.598
Since the Spirit Plaque from Songrim
was found in the wagon,

41:15.681 --> 41:18.184
they won't be able
to raise concern for this incident.

41:18.267 --> 41:21.353
Naksu continues to help us after she died.

41:21.896 --> 41:23.189
[laughs]

41:24.857 --> 41:27.943
I'm sorry for the trouble
I'd caused, Assistant Gwanju.

41:31.697 --> 41:32.531
[groans]

41:32.615 --> 41:35.451
You devoured a person's energy
in the middle of the market?

41:35.534 --> 41:38.370
Did you think because I shifted
your useless little soul,

41:38.454 --> 41:39.830
you could do whatever you liked?

41:39.914 --> 41:41.582
[in strained voice]
Forgive me, please!

41:41.665 --> 41:42.750
[groans]

41:44.293 --> 41:45.753
[pants, wheezes]

41:49.924 --> 41:51.550
This is for Her Majesty.

41:54.970 --> 41:57.139
Deliver this as carefully
as you always have.

41:57.223 --> 42:00.726
I will make sure
Her Majesty receives it right away.

42:11.195 --> 42:13.113
We'll have to discard him soon.

42:13.197 --> 42:15.658
Go and find me another suitable eunuch.

42:16.659 --> 42:19.203
And then I will shift
your soul into his body.

42:22.081 --> 42:23.749
Shift my soul into the body of a eunuch?

42:24.667 --> 42:27.419
[chuckles softly]
What? A eunuch's not your liking?

42:30.256 --> 42:32.550
If that is your will, Danju,
I will do as you say.

42:32.633 --> 42:35.719
Are you still safely carrying
the Soul Ejector, Gil-ju?

42:35.803 --> 42:36.720
Yes.

42:45.437 --> 42:48.899
I wanted to refrain from shifting souls
because of Songrim's been around.

42:50.526 --> 42:54.697
But it seems that I have no choice
if I'm to properly serve Her Majesty.

43:00.744 --> 43:03.789
[Heo Yeom] Because an item from Songrim
was found in that wagon,

43:03.872 --> 43:05.958
coming out of Cheonbugwan,

43:06.041 --> 43:08.919
we can't ask them about any of it.
[clicks tongue]

43:09.003 --> 43:11.880
Find out whose Spirit Plaque
this belongs to.

43:12.464 --> 43:16.427
Actually, Uk recently lost
his Spirit Plaque, didn't he?

43:17.011 --> 43:20.431
Hey, judging by that burn mark,
I think that's his Plaque.

43:21.807 --> 43:23.100
This is Uk's you said?

43:23.183 --> 43:24.852
Uk, that little-- Huh?

43:24.935 --> 43:27.313
Even when he's gone,
he's still causing trouble.

43:27.396 --> 43:29.148
I want the two of you to go and find Uk

43:29.231 --> 43:31.650
to ask him exactly where
and how he lost this.

43:32.318 --> 43:33.152
Fast as you can.

43:33.986 --> 43:34.903
- Yes, my lord.
- My lord.

43:34.987 --> 43:37.740
[dramatic music]

44:06.101 --> 44:06.935
[laughs softly]

44:10.814 --> 44:11.649
[door opens]

44:16.111 --> 44:18.989
This is from Jin Mu,
the Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

44:27.414 --> 44:31.502
What is it that the Assistant Gwanju
always sends you, my Queen?

44:32.252 --> 44:36.131
He's been sending over medicinal herbs
that I take for my health.

44:36.215 --> 44:37.132
[chuckles]

44:38.550 --> 44:40.761
He's much more thoughtful
than what you would expect.

44:40.844 --> 44:41.679
[Queen] Hmm.

44:55.818 --> 44:56.735
[Jang Uk] Oh, Mu-deok.

44:56.819 --> 44:59.405
Master Lee's going to pick some herbs,
so I'm going to go with him.

44:59.488 --> 45:00.531
So, what about your training?

45:00.614 --> 45:02.491
I need to earn my keep
before staying here.

45:02.574 --> 45:03.534
See you later, okay?

45:03.617 --> 45:04.993
- Shall we go?
- [Master Lee] Mm.

45:06.120 --> 45:07.663
[Jang Uk] Is the view really that special?

45:07.746 --> 45:10.541
- [Master Lee] It's magnificent.
- Wow, I can't wait to see it, then.

45:10.624 --> 45:11.458
[scoffs]

45:14.294 --> 45:15.796
[knife clacking]

45:15.879 --> 45:18.257
[Jang Uk] Wow, Master Lee,
you're so very talented.

45:18.340 --> 45:20.175
I just buy what I need
and then I put it all together.

45:20.259 --> 45:21.135
- Hold it right there.
- Oh!

45:21.218 --> 45:22.261
- Like this?
- Mm-hmm.

45:23.512 --> 45:24.513
[Jang Uk] Oh!

45:25.222 --> 45:26.056
[Jang Uk huffs]

45:26.598 --> 45:27.683
- It's great!
- Mm.

45:30.310 --> 45:33.063
Today, we're setting off for a place
with a ton of mandarin fish.

45:33.147 --> 45:36.400
Mandarin fish? We should gather
ingredients to make fish stew.

45:36.483 --> 45:37.734
[Master Lee] Can you cook that?

45:37.818 --> 45:40.112
No, you have to teach me,
Master Lee. [laughs]

45:40.779 --> 45:42.114
What a little traitor!

45:53.834 --> 45:55.085
[Jang Uk] It is too salty. Huh.

45:57.671 --> 45:59.131
Uh, Mu-deok, come and taste this.

45:59.923 --> 46:02.759
Young Master, please, is this fun for you?

46:02.843 --> 46:05.345
- What do you think you're doing right now?
- [chuckles]

46:05.429 --> 46:07.598
It's just a lot that I can learn
from Master Lee right now.

46:07.681 --> 46:09.057
Who told you to learn that?

46:09.141 --> 46:11.185
If you wish to learn from him,
do it right and drink the herbs.

46:11.268 --> 46:14.563
That is… Mu-deok, I think
living in the mountains fits me.

46:14.646 --> 46:16.273
Thank you for taking me here,

46:16.356 --> 46:17.858
to such a peaceful place like this.

46:20.569 --> 46:21.695
Then you're not worried about…

46:23.822 --> 46:25.908
what's going to happen
with your duel with the Crown Prince?

46:27.326 --> 46:29.369
If you're so worried,
why don't you go and find out?

46:29.453 --> 46:30.704
[Jang Uk slurps]

46:31.413 --> 46:32.289
It's a bit salty.

46:35.542 --> 46:36.376
Come on!

46:38.253 --> 46:39.254
Damn!

46:40.464 --> 46:41.673
Stop!

46:41.757 --> 46:42.758
[grunts]

46:44.676 --> 46:45.677
Hey!

46:48.263 --> 46:49.473
Mu-deok, just put it down.

46:50.432 --> 46:52.351
Don't you dare throw that
at your Young Master.

46:52.935 --> 46:54.811
I said I would kill you
if you ever became useless.

46:56.188 --> 46:57.272
How are you going to kill me?

46:57.356 --> 46:59.525
I'm a mage who's mastered Jipsu,
and you are just Mu-deok.

47:01.443 --> 47:03.153
Don't act like you're still Naksu, okay?

47:05.822 --> 47:07.491
Stop that! Damn! You just threw it.

47:08.200 --> 47:11.036
You and I have no room
for peace and serenity in our worlds.

47:11.119 --> 47:12.329
I will destroy it.

47:18.835 --> 47:19.670
What's wrong?

47:20.420 --> 47:22.422
I'm finally at peace.
Why can't you just let me have that?

47:22.506 --> 47:24.383
Can you seriously tell me you enjoy that?

47:25.634 --> 47:26.510
I do.

47:26.593 --> 47:29.513
I enjoy living here.
You're free to leave now.

47:29.596 --> 47:32.182
I genuinely like living this way.
But if you don't, Master,

47:32.724 --> 47:34.351
then, you can go.

47:37.062 --> 47:38.397
You asshole.

47:39.273 --> 47:41.441
You know that I have to hold on to you.

47:41.984 --> 47:44.236
But now you're handing me a knife
and telling me to cut the rope?

47:46.071 --> 47:46.947
You coward.

47:54.454 --> 47:55.914
[sighs]
Damn!

47:59.543 --> 48:01.545
[ominous music]

48:14.975 --> 48:17.352
[birds chirp]

48:18.604 --> 48:20.147
I have found a way for Uk

48:20.230 --> 48:24.776
to avoid dueling the Crown Prince
and still become Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

48:25.277 --> 48:27.904
What is it? We will do anything.

48:29.281 --> 48:33.535
Let us have Uk
marry my daughter, Cho-yeon.

48:40.208 --> 48:41.209
Oh.

48:41.293 --> 48:43.712
We own the plaque
of the Unanimous Assembly

48:43.795 --> 48:45.797
which allows us to reject
even the King's orders.

48:50.761 --> 48:53.347
If all the mages in Daeho
unanimously vote for it,

48:53.430 --> 48:56.767
we even have the power
to dethrone the King.

48:57.893 --> 49:00.020
This plaque was granted to us

49:00.103 --> 49:03.357
to ensure that the rare
and dangerous spirits inside Jinyowon

49:04.358 --> 49:06.193
cannot be removed recklessly.

49:06.777 --> 49:07.861
Are you offering…

49:08.737 --> 49:11.448
to go against His Majesty
not letting Uk become the Gwanju

49:12.074 --> 49:13.450
by using your family's plaque?

49:13.533 --> 49:18.497
Only if he is my son-in-law,
and a member of the Jin family.

49:21.166 --> 49:22.209
[sighs]

49:22.292 --> 49:26.004
But Young Lady Jin
and Young Master Jang have already once…

49:27.130 --> 49:30.008
called off their engagement.
Are you all right with that?

49:31.426 --> 49:33.637
Our engagement wasn't broken
because of my heart.

49:34.304 --> 49:36.723
I still wish to get married to him.

49:39.226 --> 49:40.102
Oh.

49:41.144 --> 49:43.438
For him to get married so suddenly,

49:43.522 --> 49:45.607
I'm not sure
if he's ready for marriage right now.

49:52.739 --> 49:53.573
Mm.

49:55.409 --> 49:58.286
For the son of a noble family,
you're a very good housekeeper.

49:58.370 --> 50:01.498
I've never tried it before, but if I put
my mind to something, I'll learn fast.

50:01.581 --> 50:03.375
I like you even more now.

50:04.459 --> 50:07.087
I really wish
you would reconsider becoming my pupil.

50:08.088 --> 50:11.133
I mean, have you ever had any pupil
that you've taught before, Master Lee?

50:11.216 --> 50:12.050
[clicks tongue]

50:12.843 --> 50:14.136
I did have one,

50:14.636 --> 50:16.680
but he gave up on celibacy
and went and got married.

50:17.723 --> 50:18.557
[Master Lee scoffs]

50:18.640 --> 50:20.559
These days now, he's a physician.

50:21.226 --> 50:23.145
- [sneezing]
- [whimsical music]

50:28.400 --> 50:30.569
You could always change your mind
and recover your libido again.

50:30.652 --> 50:31.778
So, please think about it.

50:33.613 --> 50:35.282
I didn't come all this way to train.

50:35.365 --> 50:37.576
Don't you think that fishing
and picking herbs is a waste

50:37.659 --> 50:40.287
for what that energy
bound by your bracelet can really do?

50:44.875 --> 50:45.709
[sighs]

50:45.792 --> 50:48.295
- Well, I can't even control it anyways.
- [Master Lee] Really?

50:48.837 --> 50:51.590
That arm is gonna get very uncomfortable
if you leave it like that.

50:53.592 --> 50:55.343
Should I just cut off
the energy flow for you?

50:55.427 --> 50:57.220
[tense music]

50:57.304 --> 51:00.056
Then you'll be comfortable
and average like everybody else.

51:04.352 --> 51:05.395
[dog barking]

51:11.985 --> 51:13.153
[whining]

51:15.405 --> 51:18.158
Seems I must go to the fortress.
Would you like to come with?

51:18.241 --> 51:21.161
No, I'll pass for today.
I need to cook for Mu-deok.

51:22.370 --> 51:25.415
Mu-deok's not here.
She went down the mountain earlier today.

51:26.708 --> 51:27.709
What?

51:27.793 --> 51:30.670
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk is a real, a real genius

51:30.754 --> 51:33.048
and he's already mastered Ryusu.

51:33.131 --> 51:35.717
And is preparing
in this moment for the fight.

51:37.969 --> 51:40.263
Spread that rumor around for me, please.

51:40.347 --> 51:41.181
Really?

51:42.098 --> 51:44.768
But if he doesn't show up,
he'll be totally ridiculed.

51:45.352 --> 51:47.604
[sighs]
He's not going to be at peace anymore

51:47.687 --> 51:49.022
if he's met with humiliation.

51:49.731 --> 51:50.982
Can you get me some chicken?

51:51.066 --> 51:53.652
You should leave soon.
Cheonbugwan officials are here today,

51:53.735 --> 51:55.695
since we're hosting
a very important guest.

51:56.780 --> 51:58.490
You don't want to run into them,

51:58.573 --> 52:00.784
especially after
the Spirit Plaque incident.

52:00.867 --> 52:02.869
[suspenseful music]

52:20.846 --> 52:21.847
[Gil-ju] Stop right there.

52:27.143 --> 52:29.396
Young lady, you're Jang Uk's servant,
are you not?

52:30.647 --> 52:32.274
Yes, can I help you?

52:33.066 --> 52:36.486
[Gil-ju] Surely, Naksu would not have
shifted into a body like that.

52:37.654 --> 52:38.697
You…

52:39.364 --> 52:42.742
seen me before at the inn
by the dock, remember?

52:43.785 --> 52:45.745
[tense music]

52:52.878 --> 52:54.212
I can't say I'm sure.

52:58.675 --> 52:59.843
[Mu-deok] He's suspicious of me.

53:01.094 --> 53:04.055
I have a few questions to ask you.
Come with me to Cheonbugwan.

53:07.475 --> 53:08.393
[Yeom-su] Follow me.

53:08.476 --> 53:10.687
- Let go off me, hey!
- Just stay still!

53:10.770 --> 53:12.188
What's wrong with you?

53:14.524 --> 53:15.734
[Gil-ju] She has no blue mark.

53:17.277 --> 53:19.154
Is she really not Naksu, then?

53:21.072 --> 53:23.783
I swear I don't know
where Young Master Jang is.

53:27.829 --> 53:29.039
Sire!

53:32.918 --> 53:34.127
Your Royal Highness.

53:35.253 --> 53:36.922
Sire, it's me.

53:37.005 --> 53:38.381
It is me, Filthy Mu-deok.

53:51.019 --> 53:52.437
The Filthy Mu-deok from the other day.

53:52.520 --> 53:54.147
Yes, that's me.

53:54.230 --> 53:55.941
Indeed, I am the one you bestowed the name

53:56.024 --> 53:57.567
Filthy Mu-deok, too.

53:59.778 --> 54:01.988
Please help me, Sire! I need help!

54:02.739 --> 54:03.865
Why would I?

54:04.449 --> 54:07.452
Your Royal Highness
is so intelligent and so strong.

54:07.535 --> 54:09.913
Meanwhile, because my Young Master
is so dumb and miserable,

54:09.996 --> 54:11.790
my life is now in danger.

54:11.873 --> 54:13.625
So, please help me, Sire.

54:20.173 --> 54:22.676
Thank you so much, Your Highness.

54:24.761 --> 54:27.597
What is your miserable Young Master
up to these days?

54:27.681 --> 54:29.849
Well, he cries every day.

54:29.933 --> 54:33.019
He's absolutely terrified of you,
trembling in fear.

54:33.103 --> 54:34.854
So, he does nothing
but hide, Your Highness.

54:35.647 --> 54:36.731
I see that you're more than willing

54:36.815 --> 54:38.525
to speak ill of your Master
just to please me.

54:39.442 --> 54:40.902
I can say things that are a lot worse

54:40.986 --> 54:42.946
if it would please
Your Highness, of course.

54:44.114 --> 54:47.701
Filthy Mu-deok, you must think that
I am a very petty man, don't you?

54:47.784 --> 54:50.203
Well, I am filthy
for a reason, Your Highness.

54:50.286 --> 54:53.581
Everything you wanted to say,
but fear might make you seem petty.

54:53.665 --> 54:55.917
Please, spill your guts out to me, Sire.

54:57.168 --> 54:59.337
Are you offering to be
some kind of verbal outhouse?

54:59.421 --> 55:02.215
Oh my! No!
That title would be too grand for me.

55:02.298 --> 55:04.092
But I would be deeply honored to.

55:04.759 --> 55:05.593
[Go Won chuckles]

55:06.302 --> 55:08.513
I have no need for a toilet
like you to relieve my stress.

55:10.265 --> 55:13.184
Your Highness,
although you're being so generous,

55:13.268 --> 55:16.688
could you tell those men outside
to stop trying to drag me away?

55:17.355 --> 55:18.815
Just one word would be enough.

55:19.482 --> 55:21.943
[breathes deeply]

55:26.740 --> 55:27.824
Here, take this.

55:29.576 --> 55:30.744
That's my sachet.

55:30.827 --> 55:31.995
SACHET: A SCENTED BAG

55:32.078 --> 55:33.413
If it seems like
they're gonna drag you away

55:33.496 --> 55:35.373
because of dumb Master, show them that.

55:36.332 --> 55:38.710
Oh, goodness!
Thank you so much, Your Highness.

55:39.919 --> 55:40.754
[sniffs]

55:43.965 --> 55:45.967
It… smells just like cinnamon.

55:46.051 --> 55:48.386
Hmm, why are you making a face like that?

55:48.470 --> 55:50.555
What? You don't like it?

55:50.638 --> 55:53.183
Oh, no! I very much love it.

55:53.892 --> 55:55.393
- Just give it back.
- No!

55:55.477 --> 55:57.520
I can't give it back to you
when it's already covered in my filth.

55:58.855 --> 56:01.566
I'm grateful for
this wonderfully fragrant gift.

56:03.485 --> 56:07.197
Since I am granting favors here,
I'll pour you a fragrant glass of wine.

56:09.616 --> 56:11.659
[whimsical music]

56:16.831 --> 56:18.291
It's cinnamon and ginger wine,

56:18.374 --> 56:19.667
with plenty of cinnamon in it.

56:21.044 --> 56:24.255
Ah, you don't like the smell of cinnamon.
Then just give it back.

56:24.881 --> 56:25.882
Oh, no.

56:25.965 --> 56:26.883
I like it.

56:35.016 --> 56:35.975
[exhales deeply]

56:37.268 --> 56:39.562
- Like it?
- It was delicious, indeed.

56:39.646 --> 56:40.605
Have another glass.

56:48.696 --> 56:51.950
Mu-deok probably went to Chwiseonru.
There's nowhere else for her to go.

56:52.033 --> 56:53.743
Did she get upset and run away?

56:54.953 --> 56:56.329
What kind of servant does that?

56:57.205 --> 56:59.082
She's no ordinary servant.

56:59.165 --> 57:02.544
Hmm, if she's not an ordinary servant,
what exactly is she, then?

57:03.711 --> 57:06.089
Mu-deok is a bird's egg, you see.

57:06.172 --> 57:08.424
Uh… one that needs embracing.

57:08.925 --> 57:11.427
- [man 1] Hey, look at this!
- [man 2] Why? What's going on over here?

57:11.511 --> 57:13.638
[man 3] They found the corpse
of a soul shifter.

57:13.721 --> 57:15.890
- [man 3] Yeah.
- [man 4] What? Where, where, where?

57:18.476 --> 57:21.271
- [man 4] There it is.
- [woman] Oh, my goodness!

57:21.354 --> 57:23.148
- [man 5] Look at that! Look at that!
- [all exclaim]

57:23.231 --> 57:26.067
- [woman 1] It looks horrible.
- [indistinct chattering]

57:26.151 --> 57:26.985
[sighs in relief]

57:29.988 --> 57:31.531
That's not a soul shifter.

57:32.073 --> 57:34.617
It's someone whose energy
was consumed by one.

57:34.701 --> 57:36.202
Do you know about soul shifters, then?

57:36.286 --> 57:39.414
When soul shifters run wild,
they feed off the energy of humans.

57:39.497 --> 57:41.916
That's why the alchemy of souls
was banned,

57:42.000 --> 57:43.835
and why they must be killed.

57:46.921 --> 57:48.089
[groans]

57:55.388 --> 57:57.307
Does every soul shifter
end up running wild?

57:57.390 --> 57:59.642
Not if they're able to master
something called Hwansu.

58:00.435 --> 58:03.521
Is that… even possible
for a human to master?

58:03.605 --> 58:04.814
Of course they can.

58:05.523 --> 58:08.985
Are you interested in being my pupil
and devoting yourself to mastering Hwansu?

58:09.569 --> 58:12.322
You are athletic and smart,
but most importantly,

58:12.405 --> 58:14.199
you show so much promise.

58:15.074 --> 58:18.495
I'm so very grateful for this praise.
Ah, I have no desire to be celibate.

58:18.578 --> 58:19.787
If I was your Master,

58:19.871 --> 58:22.373
I could teach you how to take off
that binding bracelet in an instant.

58:22.957 --> 58:24.042
"My Master."

58:25.627 --> 58:26.461
Just give it a try.

58:27.337 --> 58:29.297
What are you saying now?
Please, stop that, Master Lee.

58:29.380 --> 58:32.383
[Yeom-su] We come on behalf
of Cheonbugwan. Everyone, step away.

58:34.511 --> 58:38.056
Oh, I can't… I'll get in trouble
if he sees me here, so bye.

58:39.098 --> 58:40.350
[sighs]
Goodness me.

58:52.237 --> 58:53.988
[woman 2] Look there, a rainbow.

58:54.072 --> 58:55.615
- It's a rainbow.
- [all chatter]

58:55.698 --> 58:58.326
- [all exclaim]
- [man 6] A rainbow! It's a rainbow.

58:58.409 --> 59:00.745
- [woman 3] Amazing!
- [man 8] Look at that a rainbow.

59:00.828 --> 59:03.915
[all exclaim, chatter]

59:07.502 --> 59:08.586
Where did the wagon go?

59:09.837 --> 59:11.214
[man 9] It was here just a minute ago.

59:11.965 --> 59:13.675
- [man 10] Who took the wagon?
- [man 11] Where is the wagon?

59:13.758 --> 59:14.759
[man 12] Who's responsible for this?

59:15.385 --> 59:16.261
[barks]

59:29.399 --> 59:30.233
[Dang-gu] Wow!

59:35.363 --> 59:37.782
[shouts]

59:39.033 --> 59:40.702
[voice echoing]

59:43.162 --> 59:44.163
Wow!

59:44.247 --> 59:46.624
Even in a place like Danhyanggok,
my echo still comes back.

59:47.792 --> 59:48.668
Hmm.

59:48.751 --> 59:49.752
[Dang-gu] Yes!

59:52.839 --> 59:55.508
[Jang Uk] Hey, wait.
Mu-deok really got drunk?

59:56.009 --> 59:58.052
So, she's been here drinking
and enjoying herself?

59:58.136 --> 01:00:00.305
Mudeok almost got dragged off
to Cheonbugwan today.

01:00:01.264 --> 01:00:04.267
However, the Crown Prince
was fortunately there to save her.

01:00:06.603 --> 01:00:08.062
- The Crown Prince?
- [Ju-wol] Yes.

01:00:08.146 --> 01:00:09.856
She did a great job of humoring him, too.

01:00:09.939 --> 01:00:11.524
She knows how to flatter.

01:00:11.608 --> 01:00:14.527
She even drank every glass of wine
that he personally offered to her.

01:00:16.988 --> 01:00:17.822
[sighs]

01:00:19.741 --> 01:00:20.658
Where is she?

01:00:22.160 --> 01:00:22.994
Follow me.

01:00:33.630 --> 01:00:34.464
[sighs]

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:48.519
[sniffs]

01:00:49.479 --> 01:00:51.189
Wow, she's completely hammered.

01:00:52.523 --> 01:00:54.567
Hey, Mu-deok, you all right?

01:00:58.154 --> 01:01:01.074
Oh, you're here. Here's my pupil.

01:01:02.950 --> 01:01:05.453
Yeah, your pupil has come to take you now.

01:01:06.746 --> 01:01:09.499
My body will not move like I want it to.

01:01:10.083 --> 01:01:12.168
I can't even keep my head up, either.

01:01:12.710 --> 01:01:15.838
It was never this bad before,
no matter how much I would drink.

01:01:17.548 --> 01:01:19.384
You're no longer a skilled assassin.

01:01:20.635 --> 01:01:21.803
You're Mu-deok now.

01:01:21.886 --> 01:01:23.888
[somber music]

01:01:28.101 --> 01:01:28.976
[sighs]

01:01:29.060 --> 01:01:31.020
So, this body can't even handle liquor.

01:01:37.568 --> 01:01:38.403
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:01:52.208 --> 01:01:53.042
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:01:53.126 --> 01:01:55.503
I just want to give up
and live a quiet life.

01:01:58.464 --> 01:02:00.007
But she's the last thing stopping me.

01:02:03.928 --> 01:02:05.930
[somber music continues playing]

01:02:26.701 --> 01:02:28.661
I thought I fell from somewhere higher up.

01:02:30.913 --> 01:02:32.457
Looking at it now, it's not that high.

01:02:34.208 --> 01:02:36.210
[soft music]

01:02:38.796 --> 01:02:39.630
[groans]

01:02:42.216 --> 01:02:43.634
I think I broke my leg.

01:02:44.218 --> 01:02:45.219
[young Seo Yul] Please, help me.

01:02:46.137 --> 01:02:47.555
[young Naksu] I've seen you out here

01:02:47.638 --> 01:02:50.016
using that to call over
your bird a few times.

01:02:52.435 --> 01:02:53.728
I'd like to try it, too.

01:02:53.811 --> 01:02:56.230
Let me… try it.

01:02:56.314 --> 01:02:57.190
[gasps softly]

01:03:11.829 --> 01:03:13.247
I've come to give it back.

01:03:21.088 --> 01:03:23.090
[wings fluttering]

01:03:45.613 --> 01:03:47.198
[Dang-gu] Mu-deok! Mu-deok!

01:03:47.281 --> 01:03:48.699
Mu-deok was just over… Huh!

01:03:49.200 --> 01:03:50.451
[pants]

01:03:53.746 --> 01:03:55.248
Wow, you really are here.

01:03:56.332 --> 01:03:57.166
Where is Uk?

01:03:57.959 --> 01:03:59.418
[Jang Uk] I told you not to run away.

01:03:59.502 --> 01:04:00.503
[pants]

01:04:01.504 --> 01:04:02.338
What?

01:04:02.839 --> 01:04:04.048
What are you doing here, huh?

01:04:04.131 --> 01:04:06.175
You! We went to Sari Village
but couldn't find you,

01:04:06.259 --> 01:04:09.220
so we came here, just in case.
[laughs]

01:04:09.303 --> 01:04:11.305
[Dang-gu] And you really are here
just like Ju-wol said.

01:04:11.389 --> 01:04:13.808
Hey, Mu-deok, have you been well?

01:04:14.684 --> 01:04:16.686
- Yes.
- [Jang Uk yells]

01:04:18.896 --> 01:04:20.898
[soft music]

01:04:40.251 --> 01:04:42.879
Wow, Mu-deok!

01:04:42.962 --> 01:04:45.089
Wow, you must be really happy to see him.

01:04:45.172 --> 01:04:46.841
- [Dang-gu] Oh, oh, hey, hey.
- [Seo Yul grunts]

01:04:47.800 --> 01:04:48.801
She's wasted.

01:04:49.927 --> 01:04:51.554
Is she drunk?

01:04:51.637 --> 01:04:53.180
- [Mu-deok] Mm-hmm.
- [Jang Uk] She is.

01:04:53.764 --> 01:04:55.099
You two carry her up here.

01:04:55.683 --> 01:04:56.684
Come on! Get her!

01:05:06.068 --> 01:05:08.905
Mu-deok said she used to come out
to Danhyanggok to pick herbs.

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:12.199
This is the house of a man named
Master Lee, and he's letting us stay here.

01:05:12.283 --> 01:05:14.660
I can't believe that
Mu-deok got drunk all by herself.

01:05:14.744 --> 01:05:16.078
[Dang-gu] Must be fun!

01:05:16.746 --> 01:05:18.831
I didn't know
Danhyanggok had a place like this.

01:05:19.457 --> 01:05:20.833
You know about Danhyanggok, Yul?

01:05:20.917 --> 01:05:22.460
He came here a lot when we were young.

01:05:23.628 --> 01:05:26.047
He would get in trouble for sneakn' out.

01:05:26.130 --> 01:05:27.214
[Jang Uk] Yul, really!

01:05:27.715 --> 01:05:29.842
[Dang-gu] I thought his love
for birds was insane enough.

01:05:29.926 --> 01:05:32.386
But to come out to such
a dangerous place all on your own.

01:05:32.470 --> 01:05:33.971
You even broke your leg out here.

01:05:36.599 --> 01:05:38.100
I just wanted to see them.

01:05:42.939 --> 01:05:44.649
The broken leg didn't bother me.

01:05:45.900 --> 01:05:47.485
And I wasn't afraid of getting punished.

01:05:49.612 --> 01:05:50.446
[chuckles softly]

01:05:51.155 --> 01:05:52.865
I just liked seeing them a lot.

01:05:58.663 --> 01:05:59.497
[sniffs]

01:06:08.339 --> 01:06:10.758
[Dang-gu] Hmm, you really love birds.

01:06:11.467 --> 01:06:14.261
Hey, Uk, what kind of tea is this?

01:06:14.345 --> 01:06:17.014
- It has a nice smell.
- Hey, wait! Did you drink that?

01:06:19.433 --> 01:06:21.560
Yeah. Why? Is it rare?

01:06:22.561 --> 01:06:24.188
Of course. It was…

01:06:24.271 --> 01:06:28.025
of course made with a very special
medicinal herb that only grows here.

01:06:28.109 --> 01:06:29.151
- Oh, really?
- [Jang Uk] Mm.

01:06:29.235 --> 01:06:31.362
- Hey, Yul, come on, have a cup.
- Hey, don't drink that.

01:06:31.862 --> 01:06:32.905
Drink it! Drink!

01:06:32.989 --> 01:06:35.241
- It smells lovely.
- [Jang Uk] Huh.

01:06:35.324 --> 01:06:36.367
[Mu-deok groans]

01:06:37.702 --> 01:06:39.286
That's chaste tea, isn't it?

01:06:40.705 --> 01:06:41.747
[Dang-gu exhales] Ch-Chive?

01:06:41.831 --> 01:06:43.833
All of your libido's are going to not--

01:06:43.916 --> 01:06:44.750
[Jang Uk] Oh. Hmm.

01:06:46.127 --> 01:06:47.545
- Is this chive tea?
- [Jang Uk] Yes, it's chive.

01:06:47.628 --> 01:06:50.089
Isn't it really tasty, the tea? It's good!

01:06:50.840 --> 01:06:53.342
It has a lot of different things in there.
Drink up! Drink up!

01:06:55.011 --> 01:06:56.554
Ah, tasty!

01:07:00.266 --> 01:07:02.560
Yeah! Enjoy. Enjoy. Enjoy.

01:07:07.189 --> 01:07:09.150
[mysterious music]

01:07:32.923 --> 01:07:34.967
A group of suspicious men
had my Spirit Plaque?

01:07:35.760 --> 01:07:36.635
Correct.

01:07:36.719 --> 01:07:38.637
[Seo Yul] Did you really lose
your Spirit Plaque?

01:07:38.721 --> 01:07:41.057
Nobody stole it from you
and you didn't give it to anyone, did you?

01:07:41.140 --> 01:07:43.350
I didn't. I lost it
when I was walking around.

01:07:43.434 --> 01:07:45.978
Could you possibly guess
when and where you had lost it?

01:07:47.813 --> 01:07:48.647
I can't.

01:07:48.731 --> 01:07:51.233
We found it while
searching for the soul shifter.

01:07:51.317 --> 01:07:53.152
It's very important to us.

01:08:01.160 --> 01:08:04.538
[Heo Yeom] A marriage between
Jin Cho-yeon and Jang Uk?

01:08:05.122 --> 01:08:07.666
That is a magnificent idea, huh?

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:09.210
But when two people get married,

01:08:09.293 --> 01:08:11.962
it's important that
the two actually love each other.

01:08:12.046 --> 01:08:13.798
Even if it's to solve an urgent matter,

01:08:13.881 --> 01:08:15.674
he cannot marry someone
that he does not love.

01:08:15.758 --> 01:08:17.885
Just look at you two babbling about love.

01:08:17.968 --> 01:08:20.513
This is why you've never been married.

01:08:20.596 --> 01:08:24.934
Marriage is no fantasy.
I actually know what love is.

01:08:25.017 --> 01:08:27.269
I turned my back on my own master once

01:08:27.353 --> 01:08:29.855
and ran towards love
like a moth to a flame.

01:08:29.939 --> 01:08:32.483
But thinking back on it,
it was all pointless.

01:08:32.566 --> 01:08:34.360
Move forward…
[claps]

01:08:34.443 --> 01:08:35.444
…with the wedding.

01:08:38.197 --> 01:08:39.115
[door opens]

01:08:39.865 --> 01:08:40.783
[pants]

01:08:40.866 --> 01:08:42.618
An unknown man
has broken our barrier and entered.

01:08:42.701 --> 01:08:45.121
[suspenseful music]

01:08:47.331 --> 01:08:50.793
[Master Lee] Heo Yeom, I'm here.
Come and greet me.

01:08:50.876 --> 01:08:54.672
Who dares to call me by my name, huh?

01:08:55.256 --> 01:08:56.090
[Heo Yeom] Huh?

01:08:58.384 --> 01:08:59.385
[gasps]

01:08:59.468 --> 01:09:00.469
Heo Yeom.

01:09:01.762 --> 01:09:02.888
Have you been well?

01:09:03.639 --> 01:09:05.808
My Master.
[exclaims happily]

01:09:05.891 --> 01:09:06.809
Master.

01:09:07.643 --> 01:09:09.186
- Master!
- [dog barks]

01:09:09.770 --> 01:09:11.230
Oh, my Master!

01:09:11.313 --> 01:09:13.274
- Master.
- [barking]

01:09:13.357 --> 01:09:14.275
[Heo Yeom yelps]

01:09:15.067 --> 01:09:16.360
- [groans]
- [barking]

01:09:16.443 --> 01:09:18.320
Put your swords down! Put them away!

01:09:18.404 --> 01:09:19.613
[sobs]
Master!

01:09:30.416 --> 01:09:32.418
[light music]

01:09:41.051 --> 01:09:42.136
[Jang Uk] Hey, Mu-deok.

01:09:43.012 --> 01:09:44.722
I thought you were sleeping,
but then you were gone.

01:09:44.805 --> 01:09:45.806
I looked everywhere.

01:09:45.890 --> 01:09:47.141
Are you still pretty drunk?

01:09:48.601 --> 01:09:51.020
I thought I could climb it
when I was drunk.

01:09:52.271 --> 01:09:53.314
But it's too tall.

01:09:54.273 --> 01:09:55.649
That sobered me up.

01:09:56.317 --> 01:09:59.278
Is this that tree
with the bird's nest on top?

01:09:59.361 --> 01:10:00.237
That's right.

01:10:02.031 --> 01:10:03.866
I want to climb
all the way up there again.

01:10:05.242 --> 01:10:08.120
[Jang Uk] Did you really
climb all the way up to the top?

01:10:10.039 --> 01:10:11.540
Back when I was Naksu.

01:10:13.542 --> 01:10:16.045
The moon would always look
so beautiful from up there.

01:10:17.504 --> 01:10:19.798
But as Mu-deok, I can no longer see it.

01:10:21.926 --> 01:10:24.011
I ran into one of Danju's men today.

01:10:24.678 --> 01:10:26.180
He seemed like he knew it was me.

01:10:27.097 --> 01:10:29.808
Did you by chance give him
my Spirit Plaque?

01:10:29.892 --> 01:10:31.894
I tried to sell
the Spirit Plaque to go back.

01:10:32.811 --> 01:10:35.564
But then he killed the person
who stole the Plaque thinking it was me.

01:10:38.567 --> 01:10:40.486
If I ever get captured by those people,

01:10:41.528 --> 01:10:42.571
just abandon me.

01:10:44.907 --> 01:10:46.992
If it's dangerous, of course.
I'm too weak, anyway.

01:10:49.328 --> 01:10:52.081
There is nothing really that
your pupil can do for you, Master.

01:10:52.915 --> 01:10:54.875
[somber music]

01:10:55.918 --> 01:10:57.002
I don't expect you to.

01:11:00.881 --> 01:11:01.799
Mu-deok.

01:11:02.466 --> 01:11:05.344
I think I could still climb
to the top of that tree.

01:11:06.136 --> 01:11:09.056
[Mu-deok] There are no branches for you
to stand on when you get to the very top.

01:11:10.015 --> 01:11:12.101
You must use your energy
to create a foothold.

01:11:12.726 --> 01:11:15.187
You will need to master Chisu
before you could do that.

01:11:15.813 --> 01:11:17.523
You're nowhere near that level yet.

01:11:17.606 --> 01:11:19.316
I didn't want to do anything,

01:11:20.192 --> 01:11:22.027
but I do wanna try to climb this tree.

01:11:28.450 --> 01:11:30.577
You said you wanted
to see the moon from up there.

01:11:30.661 --> 01:11:32.454
I'm the only one
who can take you to the top.

01:11:33.080 --> 01:11:34.498
So, I'd like to try for you.

01:11:35.541 --> 01:11:36.667
Do you want to go up there?

01:11:39.211 --> 01:11:42.172
You have to master Chisu
in order to actually climb that high.

01:11:43.799 --> 01:11:45.134
Do you want to go up there?

01:11:50.723 --> 01:11:52.224
Then I'll ask this of you, Jang Uk.

01:11:53.684 --> 01:11:54.893
Please, take me up there.

01:11:57.229 --> 01:11:58.063
Sure.

01:11:58.564 --> 01:12:01.817
I'll take you to the top of
wherever you want to go.

01:12:02.401 --> 01:12:05.821
[closing theme music]

01:12:45.152 --> 01:12:48.280
How is Uk? Is he doing well now?

01:12:48.364 --> 01:12:51.033
Do you really know
who my biological father is?

01:12:51.116 --> 01:12:53.327
[Dang-gu] No one expects you
to show up anyway, so…

01:12:53.827 --> 01:12:56.955
[Master Lee] And if he takes that step,
your pupil could easily fall to his death.

01:12:57.039 --> 01:12:59.166
Is your Young Master even aware of that?

01:12:59.249 --> 01:13:00.959
[Jin] You meant to tell me
that when you were young, 

01:13:01.043 --> 01:13:02.336
you were good friends with Naksu.

01:13:02.419 --> 01:13:03.879
[Seo Yul] I don't know
her real name or age.

01:13:03.962 --> 01:13:05.756
Other than where we called the birds,

01:13:05.839 --> 01:13:07.383
I never got to see where she lived.

01:13:07.466 --> 01:13:09.259
[Mu-deok] This is the home
of the Jin family.

01:13:09.343 --> 01:13:12.471
[Master Lee] They say Lady Jin's daughter
is marrying the son of a powerful family.

01:13:12.554 --> 01:13:15.349
What do you think, Master?
Should I marry her?

01:13:15.432 --> 01:13:18.143
[Mu-deok] I do not intend to stay
by your side only as your servant.
